        "created_at": "2025-07-27T17:11:13.407Z",
        "cooked": "<p>New Project Release: WoW Economic Analysis MCP Server</p>\n<p>I’ve published a new open-source project: <a href=\"https://github.com/noahmott/mcp_wowconomics_server\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">mcp_wowconomics_server</a>. It’s a research-grade Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for analyzing the World of Warcraft economy using live Auction House data from both Retail and Classic realms.</p>\n<p>Key features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Continuously collects and caches auction house and guild roster data</li>\n<li>Supports economic trend analysis including time series, volatility, and arbitrage</li>\n<li>Compatible with Claude.ai and any FastMCP-compliant client</li>\n<li>Built with FastAPI, Redis, and PostgreSQL</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The server is live on Heroku and open for use. It’s designed for players, economists, and researchers interested in virtual markets and digital economies.</p>\n<p>Note on telemetry:</p>\n<p>The only telemetry collected is what the client allows and consists of tool call activity, used solely for long-term efficiency analysis and improvement.</p>\n<p>You can explore the code and documentation here:</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox githubrepo\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/noahmott/mcp_wowconomics_server\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/noahmott/mcp_wowconomics_server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">github.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"github-row\" data-github-private-repo=\"false\">\n  <img width=\"695\" height=\"347\" src=\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/e61a5571ed6503995446067c4139fd0f/noahmott/mcp_wowconomics_server\" class=\"thumbnail\">\n\n  <h3><a href=\"https://github.com/noahmott/mcp_wowconomics_server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitHub - noahmott/mcp_wowconomics_server: Model Context Protocol server for WoW virtual...</a></h3>\n\n    <p><span class=\"github-repo-description\">Model Context Protocol server for WoW virtual economy analysis. Academic research tools for market efficiency studies, arbitrage detection, and auction house data collection.</span></p>\n</div>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
